<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,250 per dlr in Mins.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble unchanged at 15,250 per dlr in Mins.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 15,250 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 27	 November 26</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,250		15,250</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $3.697 million	  $2.351 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
